## Why Apache 2.0 for tooling

Apache 2.0 is the industry standard for open-source utilities that may be
integrated into commercial or government systems. Its explicit patent grant
clause is appropriate for tooling that performs structural validation on
public-interest data — implementers should not face patent risk for using
the canonical validation gate.

